																		Public Domain Protection Service II: Copyright Boogaloo
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/observerseptember" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1488791); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1488791&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607570585" alt="ObserverSeptember" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1488791)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/observerseptember" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1488791); return false;" >ObserverSeptember</a></span> <span class="odate time_1519776114 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">28 Feb 2018 00:01</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3724096">
									

<p>Testing the waters to see if I can get the PDPS to stick as more than just a one-off. This was originally going to be Keter, but it ended up feeling contrived so I stuck with my comfort zone. <a href="/scp-3185">SCP-3185</a> is useful but not required reading.</p>
<p>Credit to <a href="/scp-3922">SCP-3922</a> for style inspiration.</p>
<p><a href="https://pixabay.com/en/medicine-bottle-pills-medication-297778/">Image Source</a></p>

