						<a class="title" href="javascript:;" onclick="togglePostFold(event,3724096)">Public Domain Protection Service II: Copyright Boogaloo</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/observerseptember" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1488791); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1488791&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607570585" alt="ObserverSeptember" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1488791)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/observerseptember" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1488791); return false;" >ObserverSeptember</a></span>, <span class="odate time_1519776114 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">28 Feb 2018 00:01</span>
