<p>I think taking out the bit about the pain &#8212; and refocusing on the loss of memories (both relevant to their copyright work, and to the consumption of public domain works) &#8212; makes it feel <em>much</em> less fetishistic, which is the main thing that bugged me about it when I read it.</p>
